      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you Noemie, your apartment is charming.' Mathias compliments her interior decor.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "noemie",
      "t": "Voulez-vous une tasse de café?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Would you like a cup of coffee?' Noémie prepares breakfast refreshments.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Avec grand plaisir, chère Noémie.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With great pleasure, dear Noemie.' Mathias accepts her breakfast offer.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "noemie",
      "t": "Prenez aussi ces bons croissants.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Take these good croissants too.' Noémie lays out the fresh pastries.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Noémie, vous me manquez tellement.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Noemie, I miss you so much.' Mathias speaks from the bottom of his heart.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Je ne peux plus me passer de vous.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I can no longer manage without you.' Mathias admits his complete helplessness.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "noemie",
      "t": "Pourtant, vous m'avez blessée autrefois.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet, you hurt me in the past.' Noémie reminds him of broken promises.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "J'ai commis de terribles erreurs.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I made terrible mistakes.' Mathias takes full personal responsibility.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "L'agence a besoin de vous.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The agency needs you.' Mathias appeals to her proven indispensability at ASK.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Et moi aussi, j'ai besoin de vous.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And I too, I need you.' Mathias moves beyond business to personal truth.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "noemie",
      "t": "C'est difficile de tout oublier.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is difficult to forget everything.' Noémie expresses natural caution.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Revenez travailler avec moi, Noémie.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come back to work with me, Noemie.' Mathias makes his heartfelt proposal.",
